## Takeover time by trial type

| | p50 / p95 / p99 |
|---|---|
| SIGKILL | 2.02 s / 2.15 s / 2.30 s (max 2.30 s) |
| SIGSTOP | 2.04 s / 2.10 s / 2.10 s (max 2.10 s) |

12 interruption(s) are left out of the takeover times because the worker that claimed the run was itself killed before it wrote anything; that run's next takeover is measured from the second interruption.

Takeover is bounded by the lease TTL: a dead worker stops renewing, its lease expires, and the next poll claims the run with a higher fencing token.

